      "problem": "Similar to the above, this capability is marked 'declared' but relies solely on README.md and pyproject.toml. While pyproject.toml lists dependencies, it does not prove the implementation of functional support for all listed providers (AWS, Azure, GCP, Kubernetes, OpenStack, OCI, Tencent Cloud). The rubric requires code/test evidence for verification; relying on a manifest file for 'full coverage' of complex multi-cloud logic is insufficient and overstated.",
      "evidence": "Evidence section shows README.md claim verified=false. Capability refs point to README.md and pyproject.toml."
